menu "P4 capture diagnostics"

config P4_DIAGNOSTICS
    bool "Include manual RAM and generated-data SD tests"
    default n
    help
        Select test startup with w/t/u/s commands. Ordinary recording leaves
        this disabled and contains no test generator or RAM summary objects.
        Smoke and profiling builds select test startup automatically.


config P4_HARDWARE_SMOKE
    bool "Thirty-second DAC-to-SD hardware smoke test"
    default n
    help
        Adds a readback waveform summary after normal SD integrity checks.
        Pair with Feather ads127-hardware-smoke. No automatic capture at boot.

config P4_CAPTURE_PROFILE
    depends on !P4_HARDWARE_SMOKE
    bool "Measure CPU headroom during a 60-second capture"
    default n
    select FREERTOS_GENERATE_RUN_TIME_STATS
    help
        Development-only CPU and memory measurements. Selects 60/65-second
        run/deadline timing; pair with Feather ads127-p4-capture-60s firmware.
        Samples runtime counters about once per second, prints after capture.
        Leave disabled for the normal 30-minute build. Use a separate sdkconfig
        so FreeRTOS runtime-counter overhead also stays out of normal builds.

endmenu
